    "permission": "Seymour Duncan encourages sharing these wiring diagrams freely; commercial use requires prior written permission. LIMITATIONS: Two blade poles logically represent the 3-way toggle, not its physical terminals. Each Phat Cat's braided lead is modeled as HOT/RETURN. The model omits source lead construction, bridge ground, cable, and load. Pots use logical lugs and a linear scale, not physical orientation or audio taper. Two volumes make the analyzer estimate unavailable."
